      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Operate on text per character basis. i.e. each character is selected based on its intersection with selection rectangle.</para>
          <para>Strategy of operating at a granular level is maintained in the UI toolkit. A character/word/line is included if its center is within the gesture rectangle. e.g. if a selection RectF with GRANULARITY_CHARACTER includes width-wise center of the character, it should be selected. Similarly, text in a line should be included in the operation if rectangle includes line height center.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/view/inputmethod/HandwritingGesture#GRANULARITY_CHARACTER" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.view.inputmethod.HandwritingGesture.GRANULARITY_CHARACTER</code>.</a></format></para>
