      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Operate text per word basis. e.g. if selection includes width-wise center of the word, whole word is selected.</para>
          <para>Strategy of operating at a granular level is maintained in the UI toolkit. A character/word/line is included if its center is within the gesture rectangle. e.g. if a selection RectF with GRANULARITY_WORD includes width-wise center of the word, it should be selected. Similarly, text in a line should be included in the operation if rectangle includes line height center.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/view/inputmethod/HandwritingGesture#GRANULARITY_WORD" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.view.inputmethod.HandwritingGesture.GRANULARITY_WORD</code>.</a></format></para>
